    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκᾰ-πλάσιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πλᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tenfold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				16
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὸ ἔκτεισμα τοῦ ἀδικήματος
					ἐκτίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					615b
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i>ten times greater than,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				21.22.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δεκαπλασίαν</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμήν</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
				καταδικάζειν</span> mulct in <i>ten times the amount,</i>
				Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.105
			</span></i> (dub.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὑφῃρῆσθαι</span> rob
			the state of <i>a tenfold penalty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.82
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκά̆-ως</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				6
			</span></i>.</div>
